{"seq":4,"slug":"network-resilience","title":"网络韧性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/systems-thinking/network-science/network-properties/network-resilience","wordCount":1186,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"网络韧性\">网络韧性</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>网络韧性（Network Resilience）是网络在面对节点或边的移除后维持其功能和连通性的能力。韧性不仅是学术概念——互联网的设计目标之一就是在核弹摧毁部分节点后仍能通信。在软件系统中，韧性决定了系统在部分故障时能否继续提供服务。</p>\n<p>渗流理论（Percolation Theory）为网络韧性提供了数学框架。当随机移除节点的比例超过某个临界值（渗流阈值 p_c）时，网络的最大连通分量会突然崩溃——从几乎覆盖整个网络缩减到仅覆盖少数节点。这个相变过程揭示了网络从&quot;功能正常&quot;到&quot;系统性崩溃&quot;之间的临界行为。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  subgraph 韧性分析&#10;    A[完整网络] --&gt; B{故障类型}&#10;    B --&gt; C[随机故障]&#10;    B --&gt; D[定向攻击]&#10;    C --&gt; E{移除比例 &gt; p_c?}&#10;    D --&gt; F{Hub 被移除?}&#10;    E --&gt;|否| G[网络完整]&#10;    E --&gt;|是| H[网络崩溃]&#10;    F --&gt;|否| I[网络完整]&#10;    F --&gt;|是| J[快速崩溃]&#10;  end\">graph TD\n  subgraph 韧性分析\n    A[完整网络] --&gt; B{故障类型}\n    B --&gt; C[随机故障]\n    B --&gt; D[定向攻击]\n    C --&gt; E{移除比例 &gt; p_c?}\n    D --&gt; F{Hub 被移除?}\n    E --&gt;|否| G[网络完整]\n    E --&gt;|是| H[网络崩溃]\n    F --&gt;|否| I[网络完整]\n    F --&gt;|是| J[快速崩溃]\n  end</pre><p>不同网络类型的韧性特征对比：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>网络类型</th>\n<th>随机故障 p_c</th>\n<th>定向攻击 p_c</th>\n<th>韧性特征</th>\n<th>设计启示</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>随机网络</td>\n<td>~1 - 1/(k-1)</td>\n<td>略低于随机</td>\n<td>均匀衰退</td>\n<td>无需特别保护</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>无标度网络</td>\n<td>接近 1（极鲁棒）</td>\n<td>~0.05-0.18</td>\n<td>极端双面</td>\n<td>Hub 需最高保护</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>小世界网络</td>\n<td>中等</td>\n<td>中等</td>\n<td>温和衰退</td>\n<td>捷径需冗余</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>层级网络</td>\n<td>取决于层级深度</td>\n<td>根节点极脆弱</td>\n<td>层级决定</td>\n<td>避免单根</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"故障传播与级联失效\">故障传播与级联失效</h2><p>在复杂网络中，单个节点的故障可能触发级联失效（Cascading Failure）。当一个节点失效时，其负载转移到邻居节点。如果邻居节点因此过载而失效，进一步的负载转移可能导致整个网络崩溃。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface CascadeSimulation {&#10;  graph: Map&lt;string, Set&lt;string&gt;&gt;;&#10;  capacity: Map&lt;string, number&gt;;&#10;  load: Map&lt;string, number&gt;;&#10;  failedNodes: Set&lt;string&gt;;&#10;}&#10;&#10;const simulateCascade = (&#10;  graph: Map&lt;string, Set&lt;string&gt;&gt;,&#10;  initialCapacity: Map&lt;string, number&gt;,&#10;  initialFailure: string,&#10;): { failedNodes: string[]; rounds: number } =&gt; {&#10;  const capacity = new Map(initialCapacity);&#10;  const load = new Map&lt;string, number&gt;();&#10;  const failed = new Set&lt;string&gt;();&#10;&#10;  for (const [node, neighbors] of graph) {&#10;    load.set(node, neighbors.size);&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  failed.add(initialFailure);&#10;  const failedNodes = [initialFailure];&#10;  let rounds = 0;&#10;&#10;  let changed = true;&#10;  while (changed) {&#10;    changed = false;&#10;    rounds++;&#10;&#10;    for (const failedNode of [...failed]) {&#10;      const neighbors = graph.get(failedNode) ?? new Set();&#10;      const additionalLoad = (load.get(failedNode) ?? 0) / Math.max(neighbors.size, 1);&#10;&#10;      for (const neighbor of neighbors) {&#10;        if (failed.has(neighbor)) continue;&#10;        const currentLoad = (load.get(neighbor) ?? 0) + additionalLoad;&#10;        load.set(neighbor, currentLoad);&#10;&#10;        if (currentLoad &gt; (capacity.get(neighbor) ?? Infinity)) {&#10;          failed.add(neighbor);&#10;          failedNodes.push(neighbor);&#10;          changed = true;&#10;        }&#10;      }&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  return { failedNodes, rounds };&#10;};\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> CascadeSimulation</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  graph</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Map</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Set</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>>;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  capacity</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Map</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  load</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Map</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  failedNodes</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Set</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> simulateCascade</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  graph</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Map</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Set</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>>,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  initialCapacity</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Map</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  initialFailure</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)