92E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">a</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">b</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> a.value </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> b.value)[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">].name;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { score, weakest };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span></code></pre></div><p>韧性评估应该成为架构评审的标准部分。定期进行&quot;假设 Hub 节点失效&quot;的思想实验（Tabletop Exercise），或者通过混沌工程实际注入故障，可以持续验证和改善系统韧性。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>网络韧性描述了网络在故障后维持连通性和功能的能力</li>\n<li>渗流理论揭示了从正常到崩溃的临界相变现象</li>\n<li>无标度网络对随机故障鲁棒但对 Hub 定向攻击极度脆弱</li>\n<li>级联失效通过负载转移、依赖链和资源竞争在网络中传播</li>\n<li>韧性设计策略包括冗余、隔离、降级和自愈四个层级</li>\n<li>韧性的量化度量需要综合随机故障、定向攻击、级联遏制和恢复速度四个维度</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"网络韧性","id":"网络韧性"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"故障传播与级联失效","id":"故障传播与级联失效"},{"level":2,"text":"韧性设计策略","id":"韧性设计策略"},{"level":2,"text":"韧性的量化度量","id":"韧性的量化度量"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"社区结构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/systems-thinking/network-science/network-properties/community-structure"},"next":{"title":"网络扩散","url":"/l-doc-books/h/systems-thinking/network-science/network-dynamics/diffusion-on-networks"}}